        "id": "devotion",
        "name": "Beyond the Chrysalis · devotion",
        "source": "Weapon",
        "category": "weapon",
        "defaultEnabled": true,
        "description": "Each time the equipping character uses their Elemental Skill or Elemental Burst, they gain one of the following three effects in sequence:Winds of Devotion: Increases the equipping character's CRIT DMG by 56%/72%/88%/104%/120% for 10s;Winds of Defiance: Increases Stellar Swirl reaction DMG dealt by the equipping character by 36%/45%/54%/63%/72% for 10s; andWinds of Plenty: Regenerates 5/5.5/6/6.5/7 Elemental Energy for the equipping character. Up to 5/5.5/6/6.5/7 Elemental Energy can be regenerated in this way every 4s.The aforementioned effects are removed and the sequence is reset when the equipping character leaves the field. Combat snapshot: set the controls for this hit; durations, stack consumption, healing, energy and cooldowns are not simulated.",
